<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5442" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμορφ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>misshapen, unsightly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυνή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.196
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thgn.
					1021
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στολήν γ᾽ ἄμορφον ἀμφὶ σὼμ᾽ ἔχεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					554
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῦθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					752a
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμορφέστατος</span> (as if from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμορφής</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i> l.c.: regul. 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					8.17
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Mar.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			, etc. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φως</span>”
				<i>uglily,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Am.</u>
					41
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>without form, shapeless,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				51a
			</span></i>: c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ἐκείνων ἁπασῶν τῶν
				ἰδεῶν</span>
			<i>without partaking of</i> their <i>form,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				50d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ὕλη τὸ ἄ. ἔχει πρὶν λαβεῖν τὴν
					μορφήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					191a10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> metaph.,
				<i>degrading,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				855c
			</span></i>.</div>
